{
  "sourceLanguage": "zh-Hant",
  "strings": {
    "%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ 一次付清，不會續訂": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ once. No renewals."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 一次付清，不會續訂"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ 已恢復自動鎖定與解鎖": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ resumed automatic lock and unlock"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 已恢復自動鎖定與解鎖"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ 已暫停自動鎖定與解鎖": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ paused automatic lock and unlock"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 已暫停自動鎖定與解鎖"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ 已自動鎖定：你離開了": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ locked automatically because you left"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 已自動鎖定：你離開了"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ 已鎖定": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ is locked"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 已鎖定"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@（家人共享）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ (Family Sharing)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@（家人共享）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld 分鐘": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld min"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 分鐘"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld 天後每年 %@，自動續訂，可隨時取消": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%2$@ per year after %1$lld days. Renews automatically; cancel anytime."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$lld 天後每年 %2$@，自動續訂，可隨時取消"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld 天後每月 %@，自動續訂，可隨時取消": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%2$@ per month after %1$lld days. Renews automatically; cancel anytime."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$lld 天後每月 %2$@，自動續訂，可隨時取消"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1 小時": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1 Hour"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1 小時"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "15 分鐘": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "15 Minutes"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "15 分鐘"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "4 小時": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "4 Hours"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "4 小時"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App Store 暫時沒有提供 Presence Pro 的方案，請稍後再試。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Presence Pro plans aren't available from the App Store right now. Please try again later."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App Store 暫時沒有提供 Presence Pro 的方案，請稍後再試。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple Watch 也是簡報筆": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your Apple Watch is a clicker too"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple Watch 也是簡報筆"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple Watch 也能翻頁": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Change slides from Apple Watch"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple Watch 也能翻頁"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mac 因為你離開而自動鎖定、或你不在附近時被手動解鎖，會發通知給你。簡報設了演講長度時，剩 5 分鐘和時間到也會通知。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You'll get a notification when your Mac locks because you left, or is unlocked by hand while you're away. If you set a talk length, you'll also be notified with 5 minutes left and when time is up."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mac 因為你離開而自動鎖定、或你不在附近時被手動解鎖，會發通知給你。簡報設了演講長度時，剩 5 分鐘和時間到也會通知。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mac 已鎖定": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mac Locked"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mac 已鎖定"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mac 最前面是「%@」，翻頁的按鍵會送到那裡。請先切回簡報。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@” is in front on your Mac, so slide keys will go there. Switch back to your presentation first."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mac 最前面是「%@」，翻頁的按鍵會送到那裡。請先切回簡報。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mac 狀態": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mac Status"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mac 狀態"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Presence Pro": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Presence Pro"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Presence Pro"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Presence Remote": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Presence Remote"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Presence Remote"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Presence Remote 透過藍牙連到 Mac 上的 Presence，指令都經過加密。Apple Watch 會透過這支 iPhone 取得配對。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Presence Remote connects to Presence on your Mac over Bluetooth, and every command is encrypted. Your Apple Watch gets the pairing from this iPhone."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Presence Remote 透過藍牙連到 Mac 上的 Presence，指令都經過加密。Apple Watch 會透過這支 iPhone 取得配對。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Works with the free Presence for Mac": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Works with the free Presence for Mac"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Works with the free Presence for Mac"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iPhone 變成簡報筆": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your iPhone is now a clicker"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iPhone 變成簡報筆"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "·": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "·"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "·"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一次買斷": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lifetime"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一次買斷"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "上一頁": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Previous Slide"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上一頁"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "上一頁、跳頁、黑畫面、開始與結束播放": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Go back, jump to a slide, black out the screen, start and end the show"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上一頁、跳頁、黑畫面、開始與結束播放"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "下一頁": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Next Slide"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下一頁"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "下次續訂": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Renews"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下次續訂"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不用另外買遙控器，也不用裝接收器。Mac 上的 Presence 收到指令，就幫你翻頁。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No clicker to buy and no receiver to plug in. Presence on your Mac changes the slides for you."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不用另外買遙控器，也不用裝接收器。Mac 上的 Presence 收到指令，就幫你翻頁。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不限時間": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No Time Limit"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不限時間"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "之後再說": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not Now"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "之後再說"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "之後要重新掃描 QR code 才能再控制這台 Mac。Apple Watch 也會一起取消。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You'll need to scan the QR code again to control this Mac. Your Apple Watch will be unpaired too."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "之後要重新掃描 QR code 才能再控制這台 Mac。Apple Watch 也會一起取消。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "也可以對 Siri 說「用 Presence Remote 鎖定電腦」，或把「鎖定 Mac」加到動作按鈕、控制中心或「捷徑」。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You can also say “Lock computer with Presence Remote” to Siri, or add Lock Mac to the Action button, Control Center, or Shortcuts."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "也可以對 Siri 說「用 Presence Remote 鎖定電腦」，或把「鎖定 Mac」加到動作按鈕、控制中心或「捷徑」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "付一次，之後不再收費": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pay once, never again"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "付一次，之後不再收費"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你不在附近時，%@ 被手動解鎖了": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ was unlocked manually while you were away"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
